@startuml
title Shenandoah Region 化堆与 CSet 选择
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor white
left to right direction
component "R0\n垃圾 85%\n→ 入选 CSet" as R0 #lightpink
component "R1\n垃圾 40%\n→ 入选 CSet" as R1 #lightpink
component "R2\n垃圾 5%\n（低于阈值，保留）" as R2 #lightyellow
component "R3\n全空\n→ 立即回收" as R3 #lightgreen
component "R4\nHumongous\n大对象区" as R4 #lightblue
component "R5\n垃圾 70%\n→ 入选 CSet" as R5 #lightpink
R0 --> R1 : 候选 region 按垃圾量排序
R1 --> R2
R2 --> R3
R3 --> R4
R4 --> R5
note bottom of R2
  CSet 选择（adaptive 默认，Final Mark 内完成）：
  ① 全空 region 记为立即垃圾，先回收
  ② 候选按垃圾量降序排序
  ③ 未满足 min_garbage 前不受阈值限制
  ④ 之后只收垃圾占比 > ShenandoahGarbageThreshold(25%)
  ⑤ CSet 总量受 ShenandoahEvacReserve(5%) 与
     ShenandoahEvacWaste(1.2) 折算的上限约束
end note
note bottom of R4
  对象大小 ≥ region 的 ShenandoahHumongousThreshold(100%)
  时进入连续的 Humongous region，单独处理
end note
@enduml
